- Payment processing, bidding, contracts, or financial settlement.
- Laboratory testing or formal certification.
- Advanced spatial prediction or satellite monitoring.
- Claims that the application guarantees biomass quality, quantity, availability, or a successful transaction.

An inquiry is a request for information or coordination. It is not automatically a reservation, purchase, contract, or completed sale.

An aggregation group is an information-level grouping unless the thesis and approved system design explicitly establish otherwise. Do not imply that grouping records means the physical materials have been collected or stored together.

